# pytest's own cache. It self-ignores via a nested `.pytest_cache/.gitignore`,
# which Prettier's default ignore-path (root .gitignore + this file) does not
# read -- so `--check .` warns on `.pytest_cache/README.md`, a file pytest
# wrote and nobody here maintains. Harmless today only because CI's checkout
# has no cache when the Prettier step runs; the day anything invokes pytest
# earlier in that job, CI goes red on a file the PR did not touch.
.pytest_cache/

